@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@authToken = <your_token_here>

### AppController_getApiStats
GET {{baseUrl}}/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### AppController_getHealth
GET {{baseUrl}}/health HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Listar todas as comunidades
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/communities HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Criar nova comunidade
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/communities HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{}

### Obter minha comunidade
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/communities/me HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Buscar comunidade por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/communities/{id} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Atualizar comunidade
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/communities/{id} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{}

### Deletar comunidade
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/communities/{id} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Autenticar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signin HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{}

### Encerrar sessão
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signout HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{}

### Solicitar recuperação de senha
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password/reset/token HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{}

### Redefinir senha
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password/reset HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{}

### Obter perfil do usuário logado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### [ADMIN] Criar novo usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/admin/users HTTP/1.1
